#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/dtypes/index.rst:123
msgid ""
"Use for pure FP4 workloads on tcgen05 mxf4 / mxf4nvf4 (packed SMEM, half the "
"footprint). Global tensors and packed SMEM roundtrips use this dtype. TMA: "
"``CU_TENSOR_MAP_DATA_TYPE_16U4_ALIGN8B``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/dtypes/index.rst:132
msgid ""
"Only for tcgen05 ``kind::f8f6f4`` and block-scaled ``kind::mxf8f6f4`` mixed-"
"precision paths. It models the SMEM-side unpacked layout, one FP4 value per "
"byte slot, and pairs with TMA ``CU_TENSOR_MAP_DATA_TYPE_16U4_ALIGN16B``. Not "
"for mxf4 / mxf4nvf4 packed FP4 kernels or general SIMT copy/cast paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/dtypes/index.rst:168
msgid ""
"TS variants (A in TMEM) skip validation because A/B dtypes may legitimately "
"differ. Only TCGEN05 f8f6f4-family paths should opt in to mixed A/B dtypes."
msgstr ""

